{"last_link_id": 20, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["放大：推荐lanczos\n缩小：area"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "title": "推荐", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 133.30169677734375], "pos": [535.1410522460938, 429.02392578125], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI Scale Image 缩放算法对比表\n| 算法 | 核心原理 | 视觉效果 | 适用场景 | 不适用场景 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `nearest-exact` | 放大时直接复制最近的像素，不做任何计算 | 边缘锐利、块状感强，完全保留像素风格，锯齿感明显 | 像素画、矢量风格、需要保留硬边缘的场景 | 真实照片、追求平滑过渡的放大场景 |\n| `bilinear` | 用4个相邻像素做线性加权平均 | 平滑柔和，锯齿比nearest少，但会有轻微模糊 | 快速缩放、草稿处理、低倍数放大 | 追求极致清晰的高清放大 |\n| `area` | 取目标区域内所有像素的平均值 | 缩小场景下可有效避免锯齿和摩尔纹；放大时表现偏模糊 | 图像缩小/降采样（如大参考图压到512×512） | 放大场景（尤其是高倍数放大） |\n| `bicubic` | 用16个相邻像素做三次曲线拟合 | 比bilinear更清晰，边缘更锐利，细节保留更好 | 通用缩放、大部分常规场景 | 高倍数放大（易出现轻微“过冲”伪影） |\n| `lanczos` | 用sinc函数做高阶插值，是这几种里最高阶的 | 最清晰，细节保留最好，边缘锐利，同时锯齿最少 | 放大场景（尤其是2x、4x高倍数放大） | 缩小场景（速度慢，与area相比优势不明显） |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1063.65869140625, 264.77593994140625], "pos": [1185.43701171875, 168.64620971679688], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [1], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [388.6292724609375, 460.126220703125], "pos": [66.32325744628906, 181.1590576171875], "widgets_values": ["c4cdf04cbc9f938a3ec3a9023a3f9efc1c77405fb9215e7cf3f25ee4959230db.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["参数\t                                    含义\t                                            说明\nimage\t                            输入图像\t                                     要缩放的原图\nupscale_method\t            缩放算法\t                                     你当前用的 lanczos 是高质量插值算法，适合上采样；其他常用的还有 bilinear、bicubic\nmegapixels\t                    目标总像素（百万像素）\t             1.00 代表 100 万像素（约等于 1024×1024 的总像素）\nresolution_steps\t            分步缩放次数\t                             当前为 1，代表一次缩放到目标尺寸；数值越大，缩放越平滑，减少锯齿 / 伪影"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [718.911865234375, 140.68899536132812], "pos": [530.978271484375, 609.1988525390625], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "original_size", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [363.6851501464844, 330], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1864.8533935546875, -228.9903106689453], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "letterbox", "lanczos", "8", "None", 1024, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "mask", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspect_ratio"}, {"widget": {"name": "proportional_width"}, "name": "proportional_width", "label": "proportional_width", "type": "INT", "localize